# Key mappings
unmap t
unmap x
unmap r
unmap b
unmap B
unmap o
unmap O
unmap T
unmap W

map <down> scrollDown
map <up> scrollUp

map <PageUp> scrollPageUp
map <PageDown> scrollPageDown

unmap d
map <c-d> scrollPageDown

unmap u
map <c-u> scrollPageUp

unmap J
map J nextTab

unmap K
map K previousTab

map < goBack
map > goForward

unmap H
unmap L
map H moveTabLeft
map L moveTabRight

map gb visitPreviousTab
map <c-6> visitPreviousTab
map <c-p> Vomnibar.activate
map <c-b> Vomnibar.activateBookmarks
map <c-t> Vomnibar.activateTabSelection
map <c-W> closeOtherTabs
map g0 lastTab

unmap yy
map yl copyCurrentUrl
map yyp duplicateTab
